{"number_of_pages": 91, "covers": [2188802], "lc_classifications": ["NC248.M32 A4 1998"], "genres": ["Notebooks, sketchbooks, etc."], "source_records": ["amazon:2909351475", "marc:marc_loc_2016/BooksAll.2016.part28.utf8:61415325:687", "marc:marc_columbia/Columbia-extract-20221130-005.mrc:297487349:940", "marc:harvard_bibliographic_metadata/20220215_023.bib.mrc:125843700:1545"], "title": "Dessins", "languages": [{"key": "/languages/fre"}], "subjects": ["Malraux, André, 1901-1976 -- Notebooks, sketchbooks, etc.", "Doodles."], "publish_country": "fr ", "by_statement": "André Malraux ; [présenté par] Madeleine Malraux, Iñigo de Satrústegui.", "oclc_numbers": ["40782711", "41834869"], "type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "other_titles": ["André Malraux, dessins"], "publishers": ["Mollat"], "key": "/books/OL75645M", "authors": [{"key": "/authors/OL50741A"}], "publish_places": ["[Bordeaux]"], "pagination": "91 p. :", "lccn": ["99177848"], "identifiers": {"goodreads": ["7139104"]}, "isbn_10": ["2909351475"], "publish_date": "1998", "works": [{"key": "/works/OL652861W"}], "description": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "Nommés \"dyables\", ces dessins ont peuplé l'imaginaire de Malraux depuis l'adolescence. Ecrivant alors des contes étranges il dessine de petits personnages farfelus que l'on retrouve en marge de manuscrits, en dédicace, sur des feuillets de papier libre, divertissement qu'il a gardé tout au long de sa vie."}, "latest_revision": 8, "revision": 8, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2008-04-01T03:28:50.625462"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2025-12-02T13:20:44.619522"}}